msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: en\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"

msgid "verify_email.subject"
msgstr "Your Awrad verification code"

msgid "verify_email.body"
msgstr ""
"Assalamu alaikum,\n"
"\n"
"Your Awrad verification code is %{code}.\n"
"\n"
"Type it in the app to verify your email. It expires in %{minutes} minutes.\n"
"\n"
"If you didn't create an Awrad account, you can ignore this email.\n"

msgid "reset_password.subject"
msgstr "Your Awrad password reset code"

msgid "reset_password.body"
msgstr ""
"Assalamu alaikum,\n"
"\n"
"Your Awrad password reset code is %{code}.\n"
"\n"
"Type it in the app to choose a new password. It expires in %{minutes} minutes.\n"
"\n"
"Resetting your password signs you out on every device.\n"
"\n"
"If you didn't ask to reset your password, you can ignore this email. Your password hasn't changed.\n"

msgid "change_email.subject"
msgstr "Your Awrad email change code"

msgid "change_email.body"
msgstr ""
"Assalamu alaikum,\n"
"\n"
"Your code to make this address your Awrad account's email is %{code}.\n"
"\n"
"Type it in the app to confirm the change. It expires in %{minutes} minutes.\n"
"\n"
"If you didn't ask to change an Awrad account's email to this address, you can ignore this email. Nothing changes without the code.\n"

msgid "email_taken.subject"
msgstr "Someone tried to use this address for another Awrad account"

msgid "email_taken.body"
msgstr ""
"Assalamu alaikum,\n"
"\n"
"Someone asked to change another Awrad account's email to this address. This address already has its own Awrad account, so nothing was changed and no code was sent.\n"
"\n"
"If that was you, sign in with this address instead, or choose a different address for the other account.\n"
"\n"
"If it wasn't you, you can ignore this email. Your account hasn't changed.\n"

msgid "email_changed.subject"
msgstr "Your Awrad account email was changed"

msgid "email_changed.body"
msgstr ""
"Assalamu alaikum,\n"
"\n"
"Your Awrad account's email was changed from this address to %{new_email}. From now on, sign in with the new address.\n"
"\n"
"If you didn't make this change, someone else may know your password. Keep this email as a record of the change.\n"

msgid "password_changed.subject"
msgstr "Your Awrad password was changed"

msgid "password_changed.body"
msgstr ""
"Assalamu alaikum,\n"
"\n"
"The password of your Awrad account was just changed. You were signed out on every other device and browser.\n"
"\n"
"If you didn't change it, reset your password now from the sign-in screen (\"Forgot password\"). Resetting signs out everyone.\n"

msgid "account_deleted.subject"
msgstr "Your Awrad account was deleted"

msgid "account_deleted.body"
msgstr ""
"Assalamu alaikum,\n"
"\n"
"Your Awrad account and everything the server kept for it have been deleted, and you were signed out everywhere. This can't be undone.\n"
"\n"
"Practice data stored on your devices wasn't touched: the apps keep working without an account.\n"
"\n"
"You can create a new account with this address at any time.\n"
